                        <section class="pmc-journal-banner text-center line-height-none" aria-label="Journal banner"><img src="https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/banners/logo-cogneuro.jpg" alt="Cognitive Neurodynamics logo" usemap="#pmc-banner-imagemap" width="500" height="75"><map name="pmc-banner-imagemap"><area alt="Link to Cognitive Neurodynamics" title="Link to Cognitive Neurodynamics" shape="default" href="https://doi.org/10.1007/s11571-023-09982-8" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"></map></section><article lang="en"><section aria-label="Article citation and metadata"><section class="pmc-layout__citation font-secondary font-xs"><div>
<div class="display-inline-block"><button type="button" class="cursor-pointer text-no-underline bg-transparent border-0 padding-0 text-left margin-0 text-normal text-primary" aria-controls="journal_context_menu">Cogn Neurodyn</button></div>. 2023 Jun 13;18(3):1167–1181. doi: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/s11571-023-09982-8" class="usa-link usa-link--external" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">10.1007/s11571-023-09982-8</a>
</div>
<nav id="journal_context_menu" hidden="hidden"><ul class="menu-list font-family-ui" role="menu">
<li role="presentation"><a href='https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/search/?term="Cogn%20Neurodyn"[jour]' class="usa-link" role="menuitem">Search in PMC</a></li>
